Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,巡逻队 出现橙色事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patrols, we got an Orange Situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡森医生和神父失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Carson and the priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.26,0:00:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是晚上走的 也可能是今早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might've split overnight, maybe this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰里米的绿色轿车不见了 他们可能开着那辆车走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeremy's green sedan is MIA, so could be in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.81,0:00:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在山顶寨周边范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go for standard search and cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.46,0:00:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行常规搜查和掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}in our perimeter around Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睛睁大点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyeballs open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.97,0:00:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,巡逻四队收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patrol Four copies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭C'mon, let's hurry it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好别走马路 走这边的森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best to stay off the roads, head into the woods right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.98,0:01:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.19,0:01:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我掩护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll cover you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.22,0:01:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.93,0:01:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛 它挣脱开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? It got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.66,0:01:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.47,0:01:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.82,0:01:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Just keep 'em moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.36,0:01:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.93,0:01:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听见他们在对讲机上说卡森和加百利的事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear them talking on the walkie about Carson and Gabriel?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见了 他们可能也去了山顶寨 和我们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Probably heading to Hilltop, same as us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.95,0:01:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望比我们情况要好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopefully better than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.86,0:01:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道我们在哪里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you have no idea where we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.33,0:01:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那得看情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that depends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.34,0:01:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们过了莱纳斯天桥吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have we passed the… "Linus Overpass" yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.67,0:02:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.03,0:02:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许昨晚过了 天很黑 我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, maybe last night. It was dark. We…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.62,0:02:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.34,0:02:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.25,0:02:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you…?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.76,0:02:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一般戴眼镜吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you normally wear glasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.89,0:02:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I j-just …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.38,0:02:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你视力模糊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is your vision blurring?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.26,0:02:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果感染影响了你的视神经\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this infection is attacking your optical nerves,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.60,0:02:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可能永久损伤你的视力\N{\fnArial\fs30}it could permanently damage your eyesight. We …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.01,0:02:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在做我们应该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doing what ‭we're supposed to be doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.93,0:02:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该为了玛姬回到山顶寨\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're supposed to be back at the Hilltop for Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.62,0:02:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.20,0:02:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.67,0:02:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点信念吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just have some faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.09,0:02:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在正确的道路上 就算这条路不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on the right path, even if we're on the wrong road.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.25,0:02:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有严重并发症 我们又迷路了 这很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. You have a serious complication, and we are dangerously lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.57,0:02:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得上帝在指引我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think God is leading the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:02:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直都在指引我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's always leading the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.76,0:03:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.90,0:03:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.56,0:03:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们该让他开会儿车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe we should let Him drive for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.70,0:03:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该敞开心灵接纳他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we should let him inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.50,0:03:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的脚印一直都留在路边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been leaving all those footprints along the side of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.74,0:04:17.16,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.18,0:04:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 那边的英里标志牌呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, what about that mile marker…right there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.35,0:04:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这里你能看见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you see that from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.90,0:04:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.26,0:04:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.27,0:04:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,真蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.22,0:04:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真蠢 让你离开那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was stupid ‭to let you leave that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.80,0:04:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么要那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.63,0:04:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你生病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.80,0:04:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在山顶寨被洗劫之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stashed away ‭some antibiotics at the Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.64,0:04:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在那里藏了一些抗生素\N{\fnArial\fs30}before we were raided.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.64,0:04:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那药肯定还在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, there isn't any reason why they aren't still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.78,0:04:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找另一辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find another car,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.23,0:04:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,抵达山顶寨 然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll get there, and then we'll …
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.52,0:05:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.34,0:05:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,听\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.97,0:05:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是钟声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost like a bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.54,0:05:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不该冒险离开马路\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shouldn't risk leaving the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.58,0:05:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是从上面传来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming from up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.44,0:05:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,加百利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是钟 但这地方也许能拯救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a bell, but this place may just be our salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.12,0:06:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,加百利 这地方看着拯救不了谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel, this place does not scream salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.26,0:06:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.57,0:06:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.95,0:06:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}They needed rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都累坏了 一直没睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're exhausted. They haven't slept.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.77,0:06:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 休息10分钟 然后上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, 10 minutes. Then we keep goin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.01,0:06:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我往回走 把足迹掩盖起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go back, cover our tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.60,0:06:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.41,0:06:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.76,0:06:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着的原因是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a reason why he's still breathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.08,0:06:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,战斗还没有结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight ain't over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他来说结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.02,0:06:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.76,0:06:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.86,0:06:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,德怀特可能有我们不知道的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dwight could have ‭an angle we don't know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.36,0:06:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能帮忙 他也想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could help. He wants to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.31,0:06:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还不能放弃这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't give that up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.93,0:06:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚刚失去了那孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just lost the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.82,0:06:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.31,0:06:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少等到了山顶寨再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least until we get to the Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.32,0:07:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来接手吧 摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take over, Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.39,0:07:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也许你可以让亨利吃点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe you can make Henry eat something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.87,0:07:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.43,0:07:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你能让他吃东西 我来接手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you can, and I can take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.23,0:07:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.40,0:07:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是叫摩根吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Morgan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.71,0:07:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子怪吓人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid is creeping people out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.67,0:07:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你可以…让他走远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you can, you know, move him along.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.81,0:07:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你不想要他留在这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you don't want him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.95,0:07:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,救世军会出现 把我们救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saviors are gonna roll up and let us out,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.77,0:07:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候…场面可不好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, hell…it ain't gonna be pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.84,0:08:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们哪一个杀了我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one of you killed my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.51,0:08:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找杰瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go find Jerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.15,0:08:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他给你找点吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him to get you something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.86,0:08:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't wa…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.60,0:08:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么不告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.71,0:08:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道为什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.85,0:08:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.93,0:08:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经做了太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's done too much already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.28,0:08:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会生存下去的 因为他知道该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna live 'cause he knows how.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.45,0:08:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自己并不觉得困扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't bother him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.15,0:08:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他完全能接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fine with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.70,0:08:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,并没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.51,0:08:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过他现在还没意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just doesn't know it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.69,0:08:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他状态不好 摩根 你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not fine, Morgan, and you aren't, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.46,0:08:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去休息一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.76,0:09:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很失望 尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm disappointed, Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.30,0:09:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这破事本该解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This crap was supposed to be behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.43,0:09:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,三下五除二的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two flushes and out the pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.01,0:09:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,更过分的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Top it all off,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.09,0:09:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一的医生 以及那个瘆人的神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}my only doctor and that creepy-ass priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.15,0:09:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知怎么地越狱成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}somehow managed to jump ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.01,0:09:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还做得神不知鬼不觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}without anybody knowing about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.55,0:09:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道为什么会发生这种事吗 尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have any idea how something like that could happen, Eugene?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.29,0:09:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 我不敢乱猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I would not venture to guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.98,0:09:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡森和我们从来不是一条心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carson was never one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.15,0:10:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很狡猾 和他那个狡猾的哥哥一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a weasel, ‭just like his weasel brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.46,0:10:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我最靠谱的猜测\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my best stab at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.95,0:10:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑到他俩的联系和行为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drawing together ‭associations and behaviors …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.14,0:10:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个猜测很靠谱\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's a solid stab.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.53,0:10:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦他们被抓回这里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, once their asses are caught and dragged back here …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.10,0:10:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一定的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they will be …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.87,0:10:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让他们一五一十全招了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get ‭the whole story out of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.76,0:10:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 我都会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}One way or another, yes, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.24,0:10:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚历山大呢 那里是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Alexandria, what went down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.06,0:10:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在乎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.02,0:10:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在乎吗 尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you care, Eugene,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.80,0:10:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可是差点把你轰飞呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}after they tried to blow you off the face of this Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的信息已传达到并很受感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your message is stamped "Received" and very much appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.14,0:10:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.77,0:10:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我要告诉你个消息 尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I got some news for you, Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.54,0:10:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将拥有自己全权负责的哨站\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna be in charge of your very own outpost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.44,0:11:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要我的子弹制造者制造子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I need ‭my bullet maker making bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.33,0:11:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,从尸群里开路耗费了大量储备弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cutting a path through the dead took a toll on our reserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.86,0:11:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以现在你有幸为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now you get ‭the honors of providing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.77,0:11:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,制造我需要的子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the necessary bang-bang I'm gonna need.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.38,0:11:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好一次性解决瑞克问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}to settle this whole situation with Rick for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.18,0:11:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是说人是资源吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all that about people being resources and whatnot?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.32,0:11:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹是最后手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullets are the last resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.66,0:11:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.41,0:11:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西尔有优先权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucille here, she gets first dibs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.32,0:11:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果瑞克和他的混蛋小队\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if Rick ‭and his merry band of pricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.40,0:11:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,决心要捣乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}decide to pull some shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.56,0:11:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们必须回击\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we're gonna ‭have to pull some right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.01,0:11:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我们不愿那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we'd rather not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.61,0:11:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他们的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll be on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.52,0:11:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你的错 不是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you. Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.88,0:11:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你安置在你曾提到过的机械车间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna set you up at that machine shop that you told me about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.55,0:11:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将拥有一支可供随时差遣的护卫队\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have a full security detail at your disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:12:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及你保持头脑清晰所需的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything that you need to keep your head in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.69,0:12:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,让弗兰基帮你按摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got Frankie there giving you massages…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.01,0:12:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔尼娅帮你烧菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tanya cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.15,0:12:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 那姑娘曾是主厨\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that gal was a chef?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.47,0:12:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想象中她是搞社会科学的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pictured her in social sciences.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.53,0:12:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,管理人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Management.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.82,0:12:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许经营着窗帘厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe running a drapes factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.75,0:12:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有葡萄酒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will there be wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.65,0:13:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.90,0:13:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.01,0:13:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.68,0:13:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这上面写什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to read what this says.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.73,0:13:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要躺在沙发上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to be lying down on that couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.01,0:13:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,能找到这地方已经很幸运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky we found this place when we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.41,0:13:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟运气没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luck had nothing to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.56,0:13:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前住在这的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The person who lived here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.10,0:13:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是无线电通讯员\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were a radio operator.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.56,0:13:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以从这得知身在何处\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could tell us something about where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.71,0:13:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,「任何听到我声音的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To anyone who can hear my voice,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.31,0:13:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是孤单一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}know that you're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.46,0:13:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.37,0:13:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要不放弃 只要保持信念\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make it through this if we don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.39,0:13:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能撑过去「 只是个手稿而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we keep believing…" I mean, it's just a script.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.69,0:13:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对我们没帮助 - 也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not gonna help us. - Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.40,0:13:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但似乎帮到过别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it sounds like it helped others.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.09,0:13:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 「没信号」「没信号」「没信号」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look."No signal" "No signal" "No signal".
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.40,0:13:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,浏览一遍日志 我觉得没帮到过什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, going by the logs, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.52,0:13:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是有可能帮过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It still might have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.63,0:13:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这人的信号被别人听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this person reached other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.95,0:13:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是自己不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}and never found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.01,0:13:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许只是一遍遍说着这话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe just by saying it over and over again,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.66,0:13:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,让这人有了保持信念的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}this person had reason to believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.36,0:14:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,让这人有了走下去的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it gave them the strength to go on,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.83,0:14:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算没被别人听到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if they didn't reach anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 不是那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that didn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.57,0:14:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们够聪明 就会看住这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they're smart, ‭they'll cover all these passes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.68,0:14:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,和山顶寨之间的所有路\N{\fnArial\fs30}between here and Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.45,0:14:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得继续前进 必须冒这个险\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to keep moving. We'll just have to risk it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.82,0:14:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.88,0:14:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼根不会派人进入这片沼泽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan won't send his people down ‭into this stretch of swamp,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非万不得已\N{\fnArial\fs30}not if he doesn't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.86,0:14:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.67,0:14:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼根曾想找出从救世堂到山顶寨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan wanted to map the best routes with cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.85,0:14:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,最佳隐蔽路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the Sanctuary to the Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.19,0:14:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他认为沼泽太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He … He decided ‭the swamp was too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.07,0:14:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不值得冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't think it was worth the risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.45,0:15:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不会真打算听他的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You aren't seriously gonna listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.55,0:15:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对救世军来说太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too dangerous for the Saviors,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.09,0:15:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们准备让我们去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you're gonna send us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.92,0:15:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.23,0:15:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经被他们围住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have us boxed in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.44,0:15:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara has a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.40,0:15:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么要相信他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should we trust him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.95,0:15:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能会像背叛自己人一样背叛我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could turn on us like he turned on his own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.82,0:15:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不仅背叛了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't just turn on 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.13,0:15:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.18,0:15:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.27,0:15:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗西塔看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.22,0:15:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其中一个逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one of them got away…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果他们找到了我 尼根绝对会杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if they find me, Negan puts my head on a pike.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.41,0:15:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不为他们做事了 我也不会回去找他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not working for them, and I'm not going back to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.44,0:15:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选择了我的阵营 那就是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I chose my side. This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.35,0:15:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来帮你们打倒尼根的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to help you beat Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.77,0:16:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后 我知道会有什么下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that… well, I know how it ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.96,0:16:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.38,0:16:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们试试从沼泽走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We try the swamps.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.33,0:16:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯蒂和我清点完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bertie and I finished the inventory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.78,0:16:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}How bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.92,0:16:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据我们的清点 你得再削减三分之一的配给\N{\fnArial\fs30}By our count, you're gonna have to cut rations by another third.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.45,0:16:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能撑过这礼拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to make it through the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.72,0:16:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,人数包括囚犯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This number include the prisoners?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.19,0:17:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果包括囚犯的话得削减更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worse if you include the prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.60,0:17:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶稣还在外面搜刮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus is still out scavenging.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也许会带回来些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could bring back something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.01,0:17:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 你得躺下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you … ‭you need to be lying down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.54,0:17:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.15,0:17:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,加百利 你必须听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel, you have to listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.02,0:17:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的感染很严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are fighting a serious infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.01,0:17:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须躺着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you need to be in there …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.75,0:17:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看得出这两瓶是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you read what any of these are?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.81,0:17:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.84,0:18:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是抗生素\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are both antibiotics.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.28,0:18:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人可能救了你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man may have just saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.35,0:18:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一句话都不说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.22,0:18:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使成功了 也没什么改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}This works, it don't change shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.43,0:18:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所做的一切都是为了雪莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything I did, it was for Sherry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.47,0:18:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不代表那就是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't make it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.45,0:18:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你们应该原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or something that should be forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.66,0:18:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.59,0:18:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仅剩的寄托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one I got left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.66,0:18:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她放你出来的 然后她逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the one that let you out. Then she ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.48,0:18:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在外面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.56,0:18:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.45,0:18:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.76,0:19:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to be careful,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.29,0:19:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.05,0:19:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,往前走 给其他人清出一条路来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push through. Clear a path for the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.14,0:19:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,加我一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Count me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.95,0:19:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.53,0:19:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能给我弩\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can have the crossbow …
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.88,0:19:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 待在那儿别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't. You'll stay right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.16,0:19:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.79,0:19:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我殿后 照顾大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna hang back, watch over the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.05,0:19:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 赶紧搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's get this done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.44,0:20:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛格丽特 谢谢你和我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margret. ‭Thank you for speaking with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.17,0:20:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么 格雷戈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, Gregory?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.24,0:20:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们看法向来不一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know we haven't exactly seen eye-to-eye on anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.86,0:20:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,质疑过忠诚 推卸过责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loyalties have been questioned, fingers have been pointed…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.78,0:20:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,抛开这些不谈 你得承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of that aside, you have to admit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.46,0:20:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我关在这以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}that, since you threw me in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.93,0:20:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都表现得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}my behavior has been pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.64,0:20:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能出来 格雷戈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're staying in, Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.34,0:20:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.30,0:20:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不听我把话说完吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're not gonna hear me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.80,0:20:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能永远把我关在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just leave me in here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.59,0:20:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一个理由杀了你 就不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a reason to kill you, and I won't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.74,0:20:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.24,0:20:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直很听话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.33,0:20:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫我们做的 我们都做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've done everything you've told us to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.55,0:20:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而昨晚 你还是杀了我们其中一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And still, last night, you took one of us out and …
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.12,0:20:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道自己做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.79,0:20:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.42,0:20:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我们当敌人对待得越久\N{\fnArial\fs30}The longer you treat us like the enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.96,0:20:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们就会表现得越… - 你们就是敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- the more we're gonna act… - You are the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.08,0:20:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为我们不必当敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think we have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.41,0:20:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.33,0:21:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,表现好的人能出来放风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time outside the pen for good behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.65,0:21:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次一人 每天几分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, one at a time, a couple minutes a day,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.47,0:21:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,到阴凉处待一会 做做运动\N{\fnArial\fs30}some … some shade, exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.89,0:21:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想用多少枪指着我们都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have ‭all the guns on us you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.36,0:21:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.86,0:21:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有资源满足你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have ‭the resources to oblige you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.55,0:21:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.38,0:21:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以就这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that's it, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.20,0:21:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.72,0:21:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要停止供给你们食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm cutting off your rations.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.88,0:21:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,几天 也许更久\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few days, maybe longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.38,0:21:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Maggie…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.44,0:21:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的人最重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}My people come first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.36,0:21:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.88,0:21:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.08,0:22:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们可以绕过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can go around?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.89,0:22:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,最浅的河段就在前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shallowest spot's straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.91,0:22:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把行尸全干掉 人就能过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We clear 'em out. That's how we get our people through.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.75,0:23:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗 - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ready? - ‭Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.57,0:23:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁想帮我杀掉那只行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants to help me take care of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.78,0:23:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜 你刚毛遂自荐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations. You just volunteered.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.17,0:23:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的烧好像退了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…your fever appears to have broken…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.22,0:23:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的视力…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your eyesight…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.71,0:24:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果短期内没有改善\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if there's not some improvement soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.24,0:24:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕就是永久损伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid you're looking at permanent damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.08,0:24:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.70,0:24:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能活下来 你感到遗憾吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sorry I'm going to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.36,0:24:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂我意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.42,0:24:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这种环境下失去视觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Losing your vision. In this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.14,0:24:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个念头难道不让你害怕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thought of that doesn't scare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.83,0:24:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是让你生气 哪怕只有一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or…piss you off, even a little bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.20,0:24:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让上帝指引我前行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm letting Him lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.40,0:24:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我虽然看不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't even see it,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.75,0:24:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我能感觉到你脸上的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can feel the look on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.75,0:24:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说 是上帝指引我们来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying ‭God led us to this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.77,0:24:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们玩什么寻宝游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}That this is some scavenger hunt He's put us on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.68,0:24:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是说 要在此刻寻找意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to search ‭for meaning in this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.00,0:24:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需环顾四周\N{\fnArial\fs30}simply by looking around…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.72,0:24:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是感受…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or … Or feeling …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.00,0:24:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta be shitting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.22,0:24:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.54,0:25:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是车钥匙和地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's car keys and a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.47,0:25:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.82,0:25:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴灵顿之家生活历史博物馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barrington House Living History Museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.64,0:25:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只偏离了几英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We … We can't be more than a few miles off.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.92,0:25:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以用刀掩护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could cover me with the knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.31,0:25:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是可以 但我要用枪掩护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could, but I'm covering you with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.68,0:25:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一只\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.71,0:25:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定不杀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you don't want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.44,0:25:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,浪费颗子弹吗 不用了谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And waste a bullet? No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.22,0:25:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹妮斯的事我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about Denise.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.18,0:25:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是真心的 我不奢望你原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I truly am. I don't expect you to forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.64,0:25:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不配\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.83,0:25:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想要你知道 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted you to know, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.64,0:26:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该和救世军留在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've stayed with the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.79,0:26:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.10,0:26:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.04,0:26:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.85,0:26:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能换了阵营 当什么事都没发生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't get to switch sides and make it okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.21,0:26:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.86,0:26:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远都不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never will.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.55,0:26:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在这样杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But killing me right now, like this…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.92,0:26:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有什么用呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.72,0:26:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让我感觉好很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna make me feel a hell of a lot better.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.81,0:27:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道会这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it was gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.04,0:27:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想先帮你们赢下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to help you win first.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.21,0:27:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说他们不会蠢到来冒险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Just sayin' they'd be idiots to risk it is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.32,0:27:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少可以说我们搜过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Least we can say we checked…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.08,0:27:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,总比莫尼的差事好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still rather be us than J-Money right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.12,0:27:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望车还在车库里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hope the car's actually in the garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.11,0:27:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.64,0:28:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}危险\N院内有陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.46,0:28:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡森医生 停下 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Carson! Stop! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.65,0:29:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You … You … You did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.23,0:29:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能得到了一些帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I might have had some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.99,0:30:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,沼泽在那边 我们抄近路过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The swamp's that way. Let's cut through there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.76,0:30:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dwight?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.72,0:30:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.51,0:30:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以为你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought you were dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.72,0:30:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时有埋伏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.09,0:30:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们几乎被全歼 但我逃出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, they shot us to hell, but I got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.89,0:30:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一晚上都在东躲西藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Spent the whole night hiding…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.88,0:30:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道的 躲着行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, ‭running from the dead ones…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.75,0:30:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to make it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.73,0:30:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to Laura?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.91,0:30:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想她可能也跑出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought she might made it out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.12,0:30:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 小德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm sorry, D.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.50,0:30:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人见过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's seen her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.58,0:31:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们在这做什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.81,0:31:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪亚历山大那群人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trackin' the Alexandrians.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.89,0:31:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,想去沼泽探探 看能找到些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Bout to check the swamp, see what we can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.36,0:31:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚从那边过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just came from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.95,0:31:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很聪明 没去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were smart enough to steer clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.77,0:31:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 如果我是他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if I were them,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.19,0:31:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会待在伯克斯小道附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd stick closer to Burke's Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.35,0:31:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐蔽性更好 路更近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good cover, straighter shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.27,0:31:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 带路吧 小德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, lead the way, D.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.36,0:31:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没穿你的背心 几乎没认出来你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barely recognized you without your vest.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.94,0:31:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好我们没打你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky we didn't shoot your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.40,0:31:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.25,0:31:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making sure you were okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.28,0:31:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你追他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you running after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.78,0:31:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you try and stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.42,0:31:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时也没人能阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one could've stopped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.69,0:31:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.09,0:31:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定他已经全告诉他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all we know, he could be telling them everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.42,0:31:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼根可能已经在来的路上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan could be on his way here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.26,0:32:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有 他不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He isn't. He won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.90,0:32:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把他们引走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He led them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.64,0:32:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是冲着我们的方向来的 他救了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were coming right for us, and he saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.35,0:32:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说得对 他救了我们 我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right. He did. I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.66,0:32:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎他做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a damn what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.54,0:32:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可以和他们待在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can stick with them,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.65,0:32:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可以回来 妈的 可以逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}he can come back … hell, he can run.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.77,0:32:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我找到那个贱种 我就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I find that son of a bitch, I'm gonna …
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.71,0:32:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}C'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.71,0:32:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定不要我开车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh, sure you don't want me to drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.11,0:32:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.35,0:32:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.63,0:33:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.48,0:33:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands up, assholes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.27,0:33:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定是听见枪声了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must've heard the gunfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.40,0:33:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝依然在指引我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still leading the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.25,0:33:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信这点 你就能看到前路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe it, and you'll see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.74,0:33:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I do see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.77,0:33:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 那可是医生 可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}C'mon, man! ‭That's the doctor, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.17,0:33:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.73,0:34:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快他妈拿枪上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your damn gun, and get in the cab.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.70,0:34:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.08,0:34:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.50,0:34:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.54,0:34:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.45,0:34:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.77,0:36:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did he die?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.92,0:36:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们干的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it them?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.71,0:36:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当时在帮助陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was helping a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.04,0:36:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这种情况下 他仍在帮助陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the middle of all this, he was helping a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.88,0:36:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked about your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.37,0:36:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.26,0:36:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.98,0:36:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了他 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you got him, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.48,0:37:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.12,0:37:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想感谢你接纳我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wanted to thank you for your hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.92,0:37:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.20,0:37:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.44,0:37:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.13,0:37:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这里有医院 诊所之类的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a hospital here, some kind of infirmary?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.10,0:37:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受伤了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.00,0:37:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.37,0:37:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是 我有些医疗经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…have some medical experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.41,0:37:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,想着我能做点贡献 帮帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought I could pitch in and help.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.30,0:37:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在拖车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the trailers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.82,0:37:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.55,0:38:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你 大人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at you, Mr. Big Shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.32,0:38:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你命中注定要做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were destined for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.09,0:38:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,生产线上必须戴手套和护眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody on the line without gloves and proper eye protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.87,0:38:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought I could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.07,0:38:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不你教我做颗子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you could show me how to make one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.24,0:38:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以帮我点餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can help ‭by taking my dinner order,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.22,0:38:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,用长距离对讲机转告塔尼娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}relaying it to Tanya via the longrange.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.81,0:38:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸡蛋就可以 加上点番茄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eggs will do nicely. Dancing with tomatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.73,0:38:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一份番茄卷蛋 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}One tomato omelet … you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.95,0:38:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别卷 要炒碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}No fold over. I'm talkin' a scramble.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.63,0:38:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我的团队多来几份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Several of them, actually. For my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.36,0:38:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要番茄 要辣椒 多放点\N{\fnArial\fs30}No damn tomatoes. Peppers, lots of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.77,0:38:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有放多少放多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}As many as you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.06,0:38:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.11,0:38:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想把食堂设在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'd like said repast set up over here,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.95,0:39:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,西北角 我在此正式宣布\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the Northwest corner, which I hereby.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.99,0:39:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,此处为车间食堂 休息室\N{\fnArial\fs30}designate as this workplace's official cafeteria, break room,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.30,0:39:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,兼动员室\N{\fnArial\fs30}and motivational presentational cubby.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.68,0:39:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我稍后需要人给我的额头擦汗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my brow will soon be in need of wiping.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.15,0:39:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我找到了谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lookee what I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.21,0:39:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给我讲了一个很有趣的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he told me a very interesting story.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.57,0:39:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于他是怎么逃出我们温馨之家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}about how he made his way out of our lovely home.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.22,0:39:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是卡森帮我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Carson.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.04,0:39:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早说了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I call it or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.74,0:39:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am agog.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.30,0:39:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但为什么带他来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why bring him here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.99,0:39:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要人手分拣弹壳对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you need an extra set of hands to sort out ‭those bullet casings, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.34,0:40:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然他眼睛什么也看不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, his eyes don't work for shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.52,0:40:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他有手\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he does have a set of hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.13,0:40:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先试用吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see if it helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.33,0:40:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在只有少量弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only have a few bullets as it is …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.03,0:40:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,质量很高 但数量不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}quality munitions, but the quantity is full-on scant.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.29,0:40:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以要想得到弹药补给 还得几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still gonna be a few more days before we have any sort of supply to speak of.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.95,0:40:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, Eugene…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.96,0:40:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样可不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}that simply doesn't work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.10,0:40:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think a more biblical approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.36,0:40:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,用古战法制造最大的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}for maximum fright may be in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.55,0:40:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以搭几台中世纪投石器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could rig several medieval-style catapults,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.93,0:40:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,将行尸四肢和躯干投入敌防区内\N{\fnArial\fs30}start launching undead arms, legs, torsos over their defenses,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.71,0:40:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可以是头颅或内脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe heads or, you know, big piles of guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.57,0:40:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,纯心理战\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, pure psych-ops.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.44,0:40:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,造成极大的心理创伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, there's some really traumatic theatrics there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.22,0:41:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.12,0:41:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,粪堆里刚开出了一朵玫瑰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do believe a rose just sprang out of that pile of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.13,0:41:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.55,0:41:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天是个大日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big day tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.03,0:41:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought …
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.65,0:41:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.22,0:41:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命中注定要做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I was meant to do …
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.66,0:41:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.83,0:41:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So have I.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.99,0:41:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始分拣吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now get sortin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.36,0:41:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,速度快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's pick up the pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.42,0:42:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,囚犯将成对外出放风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prisoners will be taken out in pairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.43,0:42:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在武装守卫的看守下\N{\fnArial\fs30}under armed guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.86,0:42:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作 运动 如有必要的话 接受治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}for work, exercise, and, if necessary, medical attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.74,0:42:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们先开始清理畜舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll start by cleaning the stables.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.10,0:42:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about food?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.32,0:42:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,四分之一配给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quarter rations …
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.09,0:42:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 和我们一样 - 玛格丽特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- same as all of us. - Margret …
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.74,0:42:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说逼我关你回去的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say anything that'll make me put you back in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.94,0:42:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我很感激 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I-I appreciate this. I-I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.84,0:42:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,救世军依然会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors are still coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.09,0:42:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物所剩无几\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barely any food left,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.50,0:42:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,补给非常稀少\N{\fnArial\fs30}supplies just stretched out to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.98,0:42:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们该考虑一下撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}M-Maybe we ought to consider evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.22,0:42:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evacuation?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.73,0:42:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们逃跑 活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We run, we live.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.93,0:42:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我们怎么可能赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…how can we win?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.61,0:43:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看周围 格雷戈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around, Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.74,0:43:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么可能输\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can we lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.18,0:43:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门 是瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the gates! It's Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.68,0:43:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all know how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.65,0:43:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,被咬一口\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get a bite,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.67,0:43:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者被它们搞伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}some kind of wound from one of these things,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.96,0:43:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会被感染 然后死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}something from them gets in you, and you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.93,0:43:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入不死大军\N{\fnArial\fs30}You join the club…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.28,0:43:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}which sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.39,0:43:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果我们能利用这点呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we could use that to our advantage?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.00,0:43:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到露西尔是怎么和我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, you see how Lucille is getting to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.65,0:43:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,美丽冰冷的朋友亲热的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}our beautiful, cold friend here?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.73,0:44:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.32,0:44:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…at…that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.13,0:44:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用再敲敲打打\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more smashing and bashing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.28,0:44:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了这个 只用轻轻碰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}With this … Well, this, it can just be a touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.73,0:44:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者湿吻一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a big, wet kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.49,0:44:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管哪样 你都会直接加入它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, this gets you full membership,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.37,0:44:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's what we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.29,0:44:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要让他们加入不死大军\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want people to join the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.60,0:44:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,山顶寨会学会遵守规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hilltop is gonna learn to toe the line one way or another,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.73,0:44:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论生或死\N{\fnArial\fs30}dead or alive…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.39,0:44:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,或他妈半死不活\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or some kinda shit in between.
